   "h": "0 to 16: learn them by heart",
   "body": [
    "The first numbers are irregular and must be memorised. From 17 on, the system becomes regular.",
    "Careful with the final consonants: *six* and *dix* end in [s] when said alone, are silent before a consonant (*six livres* [si]), and become [z] before a vowel (*six‿ans*). *Huit* and *cinq* usually keep their final sound."
