  {
   "h": "17 to 69: the regular part",
   "body": [
    "17, 18, 19 are *dix-sept, dix-huit, dix-neuf* (ten-seven, ten-eight, ten-nine). The tens are *vingt* (20), *trente* (30), *quarante* (40), *cinquante* (50), *soixante* (60).",
    "Add units with a hyphen: *vingt-deux, trente-cinq*. But for 21, 31, 41, 51, 61, use *et un*: *vingt et un, trente et un*. (The 1990 spelling reform also allows hyphens everywhere: *vingt-et-un*; both are correct.)"
   ],
